222%22 stroke-dasharray=%226 8%22/%3E%3Ctext x=%22120%22 y=%22128%22 text-anchor=%22middle%22 font-size=%2224%22 fill=%22%23a0a09c%22%3E%E6%BA%96%E5%82%99%E4%B8%AD%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt=""><span>シソ葉</span></li><li><img src="{{ 'lilas-t-16-a075c9.png' | asset_url }}" alt=""><span>トウキ根</span></li></ul><p class="pki-g">保湿・整肌成分</p><ul><li><img src="{{ 'lilas-t-18-22c429.png' | asset_url }}" alt=""><span>高分子＆低分子ヒアルロン酸Na</span></li><li><img src="{{ 'lilas-t-19-1780dc.png' | asset_url }}" alt=""><span>シロキクラゲ多糖体</span></li><li><img src="{{ 'lilas-t-24-dc6d16.png' | asset_url }}" alt=""><span>クリ渋皮セラミド</span></li><li><img src="{{ 'lilas-t-37-ac3792.png' | asset_url }}" alt=""><span>玄米麹発酵エキス</span></li><li><img src="{{ 'lilas-t-22-123dbe.png' | asset_url }}" alt=""><span>ヒバマタ</span></li><li><img src="{{ 'lilas-t-30-1ca89a.png' | asset_url }}" alt=""><span>アラントイン</span></li></ul></div><div class="size sens-size" role="group" aria-label="容量"><button type="button" class="on" data-s="100ml" data-p="¥8,800" data-img="s100">100ml</button><button type="button" data-s="50ml" data-p="¥5,060" data-img="s50">50ml</button></div><p class="pr"><span class="pv">¥8,800</span><small>(税込)</small></p><p class="sznote">予約販売 ・ 12月5日発送</p><a class="addcart more" href="{% if section.settings.p_sensitive != blank %}{{ section.settings.p_sensitive.url }}{% else %}{{ section.settings.products_url }}{% endif %}">この製品を見る</a></div></article>
